  <strings>
    <language lang="en-US">
      <string key="name">ROOFED PASSAGE</string>
      <string key="save_name">M. Room 1F</string>
      <string key="0">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="1">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="2">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="3">{scroll 2}Crests are placed in all\nthe hollows.</string>
      <string key="4">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 1}{timed 50}</string>
      <string key="5">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 1}{clear 84}{scroll 0}\n{scroll 1}{clear 127}{scroll 0}\n{scroll 1}{timed 41}</string>
      <string key="6">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 2}{timed 140}</string>
      <string key="7">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 2}{timed 100}</string>
      <string key="8">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 2}{timed 70}</string>
      <string key="9">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 2}{timed 110}</string>
      <string key="10">{scroll 2}When the sun sets in the\nwest and the moon rises in{clear 0}{scroll 2}the east, stars will begin\nto appear in the sky and{clear 0}{scroll 2}wind will blow towards the\nground.{clear 0}{scroll 2}Then the gate of new life\nwill open.</string>
    </language>
    <language lang="ja-JP">
      <string key="save_name">館 {s}小部屋/{s}1{s}F{s}</string>
      <string key="0">{scroll 2}\n     くぼみが3っある</string>
      <string key="1">{scroll 2}\n   クレストがはまっている</string>
      <string key="2">{scroll 2}\n    残るはあとひとつだ</string>
      <string key="3">{scroll 2}\n全てのくぼみにクレストがはまっている</string>
      <string key="4">{scroll 0}\n        何だ‽{scroll 1}{timed 50}</string>
      <string key="5">{scroll 0}\n   これはS.T.A.R.S.の通信機{scroll 1}{clear 84}{scroll 0}\n  少し壊れているが使えそうだな{scroll 1}{clear 127}{scroll 0}\n     身につけておこう{scroll 1}{timed 41}</string>
      <string key="6">{scroll 0}\n  あいつらは? バケモノか‽{scroll 2}{timed 140}</string>
      <string key="7">{scroll 0}\n  レベッカはまだあの部屋に‽{scroll 2}{timed 100}</string>
      <string key="8">{scroll 0}\n       奴らは‽{scroll 2}{timed 70}</string>
      <string key="9">{scroll 0}\n    レベッカ! 上か!{scroll 2}{timed 110}</string>
      <string key="10">{scroll 2}“西に日がしずみ、東に月がのぼる時\n 天には星がかかり、地には風がふく”{clear 0}{scroll 2}\n   “そして人生は開かれる”</string>
    </language>
    <language lang="fr-FR">
      <string key="save_name">Chambre RdC</string>
      <string key="0">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="1">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="2">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="3">{scroll 2}Les symboles sont tous dans\nleur cavité.</string>
      <string key="4">{scroll 0}\nQuoi?{scroll 1}{timed 50}</string>
      <string key="5">{scroll 0}Ça doit être...La radio \ndes ＳＴＡＲＳ...! {scroll 1}{clear 84}{scroll 0}Elle est un peu abîmée, \nmais elle peut peut-être {scroll 1}{clear 84}{scroll 0}\nm'être utile. {scroll 1}{clear 43}{scroll 0}\nJe la prends.{scroll 1}{timed 41}</string>
      <string key="6">{scroll 0}Qu'est-ce que c'est? \nDes monstres?{scroll 2}{timed 140}</string>
      <string key="7">{scroll 0}Rebecca! Est-elle encore dans \nla maison?{scroll 2}{timed 100}</string>
      <string key="8">{scroll 0}\nQu'est-ce que c'est?{scroll 2}{timed 70}</string>
      <string key="9">{scroll 0}C'est Rebecca! Elle doit être \nà l'étage!{scroll 2}{timed 110}</string>
      <string key="10">{scroll 2}Lorsque le soleil se couche à\nl'ouest et la lune se lève à{clear 0}{scroll 2}l'est, apparaîtront les \nétoiles dans le ciel et{clear 0}{scroll 2}le vent soufflera en direction\nde la terre.{clear 0}{scroll 2}C'est alors que la porte de la\nnouvelle vie s'ouvrira.</string>
    </language>
    <language lang="de-DE">
      <string key="0">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="1">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="2">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="3">{scroll 2}In allen Hohlräumen\n wurden Wappen platziert.</string>
      <string key="4">{scroll 0}\nWas?{scroll 1}{timed 50}</string>
      <string key="5">{scroll 0}Das muss...\nein ＳＴＡＲＳ-Funkgerät sein!{scroll 1}{clear 84}{scroll 0}\nEs ist ein bisschen defekt,{scroll 1}{clear 77}{scroll 0}könnte aber immer noch\nfunktionieren.{scroll 1}{clear 50}{scroll 0}\nIch werde es mitnehmen.{scroll 1}{timed 41}</string>
      <string key="6">{scroll 0}Was ist das?\nMonster?{scroll 2}{timed 140}</string>
      <string key="7">{scroll 0}Rebecca!\nIst sie immer noch im Haus?{scroll 2}{timed 100}</string>
      <string key="8">{scroll 0}\nWas sind das für welche?{scroll 2}{timed 70}</string>
      <string key="9">{scroll 0}Es ist Rebecca!\nSie muss oben sein!{scroll 2}{timed 110}</string>
      <string key="10">{scroll 2}Geht die Sonne im Westen unter\nund der Mond im Osten auf,{clear 0}{scroll 2}werden nach und nach Sterne\nam Himmel erscheinen und{clear 0}{scroll 2}der Wind wird dem Boden\nentgegenwehen.{clear 0}{scroll 2}Dann öffnet sich das Tor\ndes neuen Lebens.</string>
    </language>
    <language lang="it-IT">
      <string key="save_name">Villa 1P</string>
      <string key="0">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="1">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="2">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="3">{scroll 2}I simboli sono in tutte \nle cavità.</string>
      <string key="4">{scroll 0}\nCosa?{scroll 1}{timed 50}</string>
      <string key="5">{scroll 0}Deve essere...La radio \ndella ＳＴＡＲＳ! {scroll 1}{clear 84}{scroll 0}È un po' danneggiata, \nma forse può{scroll 1}{clear 84}{scroll 0}\nessere ancora utile. {scroll 1}{clear 43}{scroll 0}\nLa prendo.{scroll 1}{timed 41}</string>
      <string key="6">{scroll 0}\nCosa sono?!{scroll 2}{timed 140}</string>
      <string key="7">{scroll 0}Rebecca! È ancora nella \nmagione?{scroll 2}{timed 100}</string>
      <string key="8">{scroll 0}\nChe cos'è?{scroll 2}{timed 70}</string>
      <string key="9">{scroll 0}È Rebecca! Deve essere \ndi sopra!{scroll 2}{timed 110}</string>
      <string key="10">{scroll 2}Quando il sole tramonta a\novest e la luna sorge a{clear 0}{scroll 2}est, le stelle compaiono \nnel cielo e il vento prende{clear 0}{scroll 2}a soffiare verso \nla terra.{clear 0}{scroll 2}Allora la porta della nuova \nvita si spalancherà.</string>
    </language>
    <language lang="es-ES">
      <string key="0">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="1">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="2">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="3">{scroll 2}Hay blasones en todos\nlos huecos...</string>
      <string key="4">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 1}{timed 50}</string>
      <string key="5">{scroll 0}\nDebe de ser una radio de ＳＴＡＲＳ.{scroll 1}{clear 84}{scroll 0}Está algo rota, pero\ntodavía podría funcionar.{scroll 1}{clear 127}{scroll 0}\nMe la llevaré.{scroll 1}{timed 41}</string>
      <string key="6">{scroll 0}¿Q-Qué son?\n¿M-Monstruos?{scroll 2}{timed 140}</string>
      <string key="7">{scroll 0}¡Rebecca!\n¿Sigue estando en la casa?{scroll 2}{timed 100}</string>
      <string key="8">{scroll 0}\n¿Qué son?{scroll 2}{timed 70}</string>
      <string key="9">{scroll 0}Es Rebecca,\n¡tiene que estar arriba!{scroll 2}{timed 110}</string>
      <string key="10">{scroll 2}Cuando el sol se pone por\nel oeste y la luna sale{clear 0}{scroll 2}por el este, aparecen\nestrellas en el cielo y el{clear 0}{scroll 2}viento sopla hacia el\nsuelo...{clear 0}{scroll 2}Entonces se abrirá\nla puerta de la nueva vida...</string>
    </language>
    <language lang="ru-RU">
      <string key="save_name">Мед. комната 1-эт.</string>
      <string key="0">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="1">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="2">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="3">{scroll 2}Таблички во всех\nуглублениях.</string>
      <string key="4">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 1}{timed 50}</string>
      <string key="5">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 1}{clear 84}{scroll 0}\n{scroll 1}{clear 127}{scroll 0}\n{scroll 1}{timed 41}</string>
      <string key="6">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 2}{timed 140}</string>
      <string key="7">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 2}{timed 100}</string>
      <string key="8">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 2}{timed 70}</string>
      <string key="9">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 2}{timed 110}</string>
      <string key="10">{scroll 2}Когда солнце сядет на западе,\nа луна поднимется на востоке,{clear 0}{scroll 2}звезды появятся\nв небе{clear 0}{scroll 2}и ветер пронесётся\nпо земле.{clear 0}{scroll 2}Тогда врата новой\nжизни откроются.</string>
    </language>
    <language lang="fi-FI">
      <string key="save_name">Lääkevarasto 1 krs</string>
      <string key="0">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="1">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="2">{scroll 2}\n</string>
      <string key="3">{scroll 2}Kaikki laatat on asetettu\npaikoilleen...</string>
      <string key="4">{scroll 0}\n{scroll 1}{timed 50}</string>
      <string key="5">{scroll 0}Tämän täytyy olla ＳＴＡＲＳin radio.{scroll 1}{clear 84}{scroll 0}Se on hieman rikki, mutta se voi\nvielä toimia.{scroll 1}{clear 127}{scroll 0}Otan sen mukaani.{scroll 1}{timed 41}</string>
      <string key="6">{scroll 0}Mitä nuo ovat? Hirviöitä?{scroll 2}{timed 140}</string>
      <string key="7">{scroll 0}Rebecca!\nOnko hän vielä kartanossa?{scroll 2}{timed 100}</string>
      <string key="8">{scroll 0}Mitä nuo ovat?{scroll 2}{timed 70}</string>
      <string key="9">{scroll 0}Tuo on Rebecca,\nhänen on oltava yläkerrassa!{scroll 2}{timed 110}</string>
      <string key="10">{scroll 2}Kun aurinko laskee länteen,\nkuu nousee idästä,{clear 0}{scroll 2}tähdet loistavat taivaalla ja{clear 0}{scroll 2}tuuli puhaltaa maahan...{clear 0}{scroll 2}Silloin uuden elämän portti\navautuu...</string>
    </language>
  </strings>
</room>
